## ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
## URFYSIO — .NET 10 / MAUI .gitignore
## ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## ===== Secrets / local configuration (NEVER COMMIT) =====
# The real appsettings.json holds the SQL password and Auth0 management client
# secret. Commit appsettings.example.json (placeholders) instead.
appsettings.json
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.example.json
!appsettings.*.example.json

# Other common secret stores
*.env
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
**/secrets/

## ===== Build output =====
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]uild/
[Pp]ublish/
publish/
*.binlog

## ===== Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code =====
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

## ===== Publish profiles (contain Azure subscription / resource IDs) =====
PublishProfiles/

## ===== MAUI / Android / iOS artifacts =====
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
# NOTE: *.app intentionally omitted — macOS .app bundles land inside bin/ which
# is already excluded above. A *.app rule would also match the URFYSIO.App/
# project directory name and exclude the entire MAUI frontend from git.
# Android signing keys — never commit
*.keystore
*.jks
# (the public debug keystore is regenerated automatically)

## ===== Test results / coverage =====
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info

## ===== NuGet =====
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
.nuget/

## ===== Logs & misc =====
*.log
build.log
*.tmp
*.cache

## ===== OS files =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

## ===== Local agent / tooling state =====
.claude/
